--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -7,6 +7,27 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add v1 `Files.Upload`, which takes a file name and a reader and builds the
+  multipart/form-data body, mirroring `CallLogs.AddRecording`. The new
+  `WithFilesFormFields` option carries the `deal_id`, `person_id`, `org_id`
+  and other association form fields accepted by `POST /files`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Retry requests whose body reader implements `io.Seeker`, such as `*os.File`.
+  Previously only in-memory readers recognized by `http.NewRequest` were
+  replayable, so file uploads streamed from disk failed on the first
+  429/502/503/504 instead of retrying. Seekable bodies are rewound for each
+  attempt and now also send an explicit `Content-Length`.
+
+### Changed
+
+- `Raw.Do` no longer closes seekable reader bodies (such as `*os.File`) after
+  the request; callers keep ownership of readers they pass in and should close
+  them, which matches the common `defer f.Close()` usage.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
